Built-in public indexers (app/services/builtin_indexers.py)
-----------------------------------------------------------
Scrapers for public sites (YTS, EZTV, 1337x, ThePirateBay, LimeTorrents,
etc.) are optional and can be disabled in settings/code. LimeTorrents is
disabled by default as of 2.0.24-dev.

Optional Redis (redis-py)
-------------------------
When REDIS_URL is set, MediaOS uses Redis for shared rate limits, session cache,
and scheduler leader election. redis-py is licensed under MIT.
